<!--
 New-member greeter (template).
 Copy to: content/greeting.md  (gitignored once filled)

 Placeholders:
   {user}     → mention
   {username} → plain name
   {count}    → member count
   {server}   → guild name
   {avatar}   → joiner avatar URL (optional)

 Keep it short. HTML comments are stripped.
 Optional KEY: lines (COLOR, TITLE, THUMBNAIL, BANNER, FOOTER, FOOTER_ICON,
 AUTHOR, AUTHOR_URL, AUTHOR_ICON) become embed chrome.
-->

COLOR: #5865F2
TITLE: Welcome, {username}!
FOOTER: {server} · member #{count}

👋 Welcome to **{server}**, {user}! You're member **#{count}**.
Say hi in chat when you're ready.
